      "message": "The domains need to be rebuilt in order for CPUs to be present.  For example, if a domain only contains one CPU, and that CPU has been paused, the domain is eliminated from scheduler domains.  \n\nSubsequently, in order to re-use the CPU, the domains need to be rebuilt.  \n\nThe goal here, is to rebuild them early, so that the CPU may be used as quickly as possible.\n\n(shall I add this to the comments/other suggestions?)",
